It ports logic from third-party works licensed under Apache-2.0:

- laya-mlx (https://github.com/mizorewww/laya-mlx), an MLX port of Laya:
  prompt construction, calibration, result formatting, routing, language
  detection, presets, and the ModernBERT encoder / decision-head architecture.
